Installed-program verification **19105** extracted `causal_study.py`, `causal_checks.py` and the unchanged `allocation_study.py`, `density_study.py`, `uncertainty_study.py` from their actual Records. Python **3.14.8** passed **8,363 assertions**, including 2,304 exact identification cases with alternative targets, 128 complete assignment laws with independent mean/variance formulas, 1,156 missing-outcome cases checked against all binary completions, the source and competing-model examples and 17 rejected inputs. General derivations remain separate from finite implementation evidence. Stage/install equality, silent import without file creation under `-B`, shared-program preservation and targeted whitespace passed. Only the first resources integration test changed; the other eighteen remain byte-for-byte unchanged. The declaration scan found no additional applicable pipe-prefixed Lince requirement.

